2. ros_control joint_limits_interface (BSD-3-Clause) -- PositionJointSoftLimits
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PositionJointSoftLimits (src/joint_reset.cpp, include/serl_controller/joint_reset.hpp) is
ported from ros-controls/ros_control (https://github.com/ros-controls/ros_control),
noetic-devel @ 633c374, joint_limits_interface/include/joint_limits_interface/
joint_limits_interface.h (PositionJointSoftLimitsHandle, internal::saturate).
Copyright (C) 2013, PAL Robotics S.L.; Copyright (c) 2008, Willow Garage, Inc.
BSD-3-Clause: the full notice is reproduced in src/joint_reset.cpp next to the ported code;
ros_control's LICENSE is tests/cpp/golden/ros_control_original/LICENSE.

Verbatim copies, for the golden tests only: tests/cpp/golden/ros_control_original/
(LICENSE, SHA256SUMS).

The ROS stand-in tests/cpp/golden/ros_stubs/ros/time.h reproduces roscpp_core's
ros::Duration arithmetic (ros/roscpp_core noetic-devel @ a1a1942, Copyright (c) 2008,
Willow Garage, Inc., BSD-3-Clause; full notice in that file). Test only.

3. franka_ros (Apache-2.0) -- joint limit values, golden-test copies
--------------------------------------------------------------------
The Panda / FR3 joint limit tables (frankaPandaJointLimits / frankaFr3JointLimits in
src/joint_reset.cpp) are the values of frankaemika/franka_ros
(https://github.com/frankaemika/franka_ros) @ ddd2fff,
franka_description/robots/{panda,fr3}/joint_limits.yaml, through the `franka-limits` xacro
macro. Copyright (c) Franka Robotics GmbH (formerly Franka Emika GmbH), Apache License 2.0.

Verbatim copies, for the golden tests only (not in the wheel): tests/cpp/golden/franka_ros_original/
(the Apache-2.0 licence text is its LICENSE; checksums in SHA256SUMS).

4. Build-time dependencies (not included)
-----------------------------------------
franky (TimSchneider42/franky, v2.0.0, MIT), libfranka (frankarobotics/libfranka, Apache-2.0),
pybind11 (BSD-3-Clause), Eigen (MPL-2.0) and doctest (MIT, tests only) are used unmodified and
are not part of this package's sources; the franky wheel built alongside carries its own licences.
